[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0010","text":"制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0020","text":"欢迎回来果穗\n……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0030","text":"──淋湿了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0040","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0050","text":"打水枪太好玩了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0060","text":"嗯，能感受到你玩得很开心\n观众们也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0070","text":"虽然反正还会再淋湿所以没什么意义……\n但头发都在滴水了，用毛巾轻轻擦一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0080","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0090","text":"…………啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900300_02_0100","text":"我自己擦的话会弄得乱七八糟的，\n所以想请你帮我擦头发！制作人！"}]
